<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to ChaosListings</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;">
        <h1 style="color: white; margin: 0;">Welcome to ChaosListings!</h1>
    </div>

    <div style="background: #f9f9f9; padding: 30px; border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;">
        <p>Hi {{firstName}},</p>

        <p>Welcome to ChaosListings! We're excited to have {{agencyName}} on board.</p>

        <p>Your account is now active and ready to use. Here's what you can do next:</p>

        <ul style="line-height: 2;">
            <li>📍 Add your first business location</li>
            <li>🚀 Activate listings across 100+ directories</li>
            <li>📊 Track your online presence with our optimization score</li>
            <li>👥 Invite team members to collaborate</li>
        </ul>

        <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
            <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" style="background: #667eea; color: white; padding: 12px 30px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block; font-weight: bold;">Go to Dashboard</a>
        </div>

        <p>If you have any questions, our support team is here to help!</p>

        <p>Best regards,<br>The ChaosListings Team</p>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px; color: #999; font-size: 12px;">
        <p>&copy; 2026 ChaosListings. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
